        new("Commodity", "Mercadoria (matéria-prima)", Instruments, "Bem físico padronizado: ouro, petróleo, gás, trigo, café.", "A standardised physical good: gold, oil, gas, wheat, coffee."),
        new("Forex (FX)", "Mercado cambial (forex)", Instruments, "Troca de moedas em pares (EUR/USD). O maior mercado do mundo, aberto 24 horas em dias úteis.", "Trading currencies in pairs (EUR/USD). The world's largest market, open 24 hours on weekdays."),
